1. O(1) — Constant Time
print(numbers[0])
Ek fixed index access karna. List badi ho ya chhoti, operation constant rehta hai.

2. O(n) — Linear Time
for i in range(len(numbers)):
    print(numbers[i])
Har element ko ek baar visit karna.

3. O(n²) — Quadratic Time
for i in range(n):
    for j in range(n):
        print(i, j)
Nested loops; total lagbhag n × n operations.

4. O(log n) — Logarithmic Time
Har step mein search space aadha karna, jaise Binary Search.
